        "Archaeologists dig very carefully, with little trowels and brushes. A whole day might uncover one bead.",
        "Early people made music too. Some of the oldest instruments ever found are bone flutes.",
        "Handprints on cave walls were made by blowing paint around a hand. Hello, from thousands of years ago.",
